# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: How to use this file
# 1. Create a copy of this file and rename it to ".env" (without quotes)
# 2. Fill in your actual API keys in the .env file
# 3. VERIFY that ".env" is listed in .gitignore BEFORE committing anything
# 4. NEVER commit the .env file to version control
#
# ⛔ SECURITY WARNING:
# API keys are sensitive credentials. Exposing them in version control or publicly
# can lead to unauthorized access, quota theft, and potential financial charges.
# Always keep your .env file in .gitignore and only share it securely when necessary.
#
# This file is a template and is safe to commit. Do NOT put real secrets here.

# =========================
# API KEYS
# =========================

# Tavily API Key - Get it from https://www.tavily.com/
    TAVILY_API_KEY="your_tavily_api_key_here"

    # Google API Key - Get it from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
    GOOGLE_API_KEY="your_google_api_key_here"